// sched_host_stubs.cpp (lane eng-sched1): the logged stubs of the default image for what the village's room script and
// the scenario layer (st1/r101, game/sce_sys; host/sched_host.cpp) reach that this image does not host: enemies and
// their list, events and event data, messages, sound, the scene attachments (sce_at: doors, items, ladders, areas),
// the sub screen, the cockpit, fades, room objects. GENERATED by engine/fight/gen_stubs.py (lane eng-e2) from the
// image's unresolved references (s/genstubs.sh of the lane), each logging its call (e1_stub_hit: the report's stub
// counts) and returning zero of its declared type; then zeroed storage for the data objects they name. Default image
// only (the fight and boss images host or stub these themselves). Rerun after a closure change.
